      "id": "kpk1-l06-a1-t01",
      "before": "kpk1-l06-a1-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "What are you doing?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "To ask a friend, say *co robisz?*. To a woman you don't know well, say *co pani robi?*, and to a man *co pan robi?*. Polish has one present tense, so *gotuję* is both \"I cook\" and \"I am cooking\". *Umiem* with a verb's dictionary form is \"I can, I know how to\": *umiem gotować*."
      }
    }
  ],
